[{"title":"定慧相资歌","author":"释延寿","text":"祖教宗中有二门，十度万行称为尊。\n初名止观助新学，后成定慧菩提根。\n唯一法，似双分。\n法性寂然体真止，寂而常照妙观存。\n定为父，慧为母，能孕千圣之门户。\n增长根力养圣胎，念念出生成佛祖。\n定为将，慧为相，能弼心王成无上。\n永作群生證道门，即是古佛菩提样。\n定如月，光烁外道邪星灭。\n能挑智炬转分明，滋润道芽除爱结。\n慧如日，照破无明之暗室。\n能令邪见愚夫禅，尽成般若波罗蜜。\n少时默，刹那静，渐渐增修成正定。\n诸圣较量功不多，终见灵台之妙性。\n瞥闻法，才历耳，能熏识藏觉种起。\n一念回光正智开，须臾成佛法如是。\n禅定力，不思义，变凡为圣刹那时。\n无边生死根由断，积劫尘劳巢穴堕。\n湛心水，净意珠，光吞万象烁千途。\n抉开己眼无瑕翳，三界元无一法拘。\n觉观贼，应时剋，攀援病，倏然净。\n荡念垢兮洗惑尘，显法身兮坚慧命。\n如断山，若停海，天翻地覆终无改。\n瑩似琉璃含宝月，倏然无寄而无待。\n般若慧，莫能量，自然随处现心光。\n万行门中为导首，一切时中称法王。\n竭苦海，碎邪山，妄云捲尽片时间。\n贫女室中金顿现，壮士额上珠潜还。\n斩痴网，截欲流，大雄威猛更无俦。\n能令铁床铜柱冷，顿使魔怨业果休。\n和诤讼，成孝义，普现群生诸佛智。\n边邪恶慧尽朝宗，蝼蚁鲲鹏齐受记。\n偏修定，纯阴烂物刳正命。\n若将正慧照禅那，自然万法明如镜。\n偏修慧，纯阳枯物成迂滞。\n须凭妙定助观门，如月分明除雾翳。\n劝等学，莫偏修，从来一体无二头。\n似禽两翼飞空界，如车二轮乘白牛。\n即向凡途登觉岸，便于业海泛慈舟。\n或事定，制之一处无不竟。\n或理定，唯当直下观心性。\n或事观，明诸法相生筹算。\n或理观，顿了无一无那畔。\n定即慧，非一非二非心计。\n慧即定，不同不别绝观听。\n或双运，即寂而照通真训。\n或俱泯，非定非慧超常准。\n一尘入定众尘起，般若门中成法尔。\n童子身中三昧时，老人身分谈真轨。\n能观一境万境同，近尘远刹无不通。\n真如路上论生死，无明海里演圆宗。\n眼根能作鼻佛事，色尘入定香尘起。\n心境常同见自差，谁言不信波元水。\n非寂非照绝言思，而寂而照功无比。\n权实双行阐正途，体用更资含妙旨。\n劝诸子，勿虚弃，光阴如箭如流水。\n散乱全因缺定门，愚盲祇为亏真智。\n真实言，须入耳，千经万论同标记。\n定慧全功不暂忘，一念顿归真觉地。\n定须习，慧须闻，勿使灵台一点昏。\n合抱之树生毫末，积渐之功成宝尊。\n猕猴学定生天界，女子才思入道门。\n自利利他因果备，若除定慧莫能论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12507,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凌云峰","author":"释延寿","text":"烟萝高巘势凌云，影泻斜阳出海门。\n曾与支公探隐去，夜寒雷雨上方闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12508,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"积翠峰","author":"释延寿","text":"翠压群峰地形直，落日猿声在空碧。\n天风吹散断崖云，古松长露三秋色。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12509,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈一首","author":"释延寿","text":"欲识永明旨，门前一湖水。\n日照光明生，风来波浪起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12510,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"释延寿","text":"春雨闭花径，晚云生石楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12511,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"释延寿","text":"草浓春径狭，树密晚窗阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12512,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"释延寿","text":"绕绣屏飞花外蝶，隔金笼语柳中莺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12513,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"释延寿","text":"言前体道乾坤窄，笔下搜吟海岳枯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12514,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"释延寿","text":"若欲受持者，应须用眼听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12515,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"释延寿","text":"长时转不停，非义亦非声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12516,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"释延寿","text":"牛胎生象子，碧海起红尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12517,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"释延寿","text":"步步寒华结，言言彻底冰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12518,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别师","author":"释成明","text":"劫火烧成烈焰城，煎熬无计拯众生。\n请师少念清凉境，此是西天第一程。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12519,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十一首 其十一","author":"释有权","text":"黑云当午蔽清虚，白雨翻空失画图。\n雨过云收山色净，赵州东壁挂葫芦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12520,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十一首 其五","author":"释有权","text":"万钧之弩射何人，箭未离弦已丧身。\n带累盲龟失浮木，欲来火里透金尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12521,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十一首 其四","author":"释有权","text":"潋潋滟滟水光浮，不见孤帆不见舟。\n斜阳欲落未落处，尽是离人今古愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12522,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十一首 其十","author":"释有权","text":"揭大夔鼓噪红尘，遍地刀鎗解出身。\n结角罗纹随处入，银山铁壁是通津。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12523,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十一首 其三","author":"释有权","text":"衣锦还乡人尽见，长时富贵许谁知。\n无言童子呵呵笑，赢得风光满面归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12524,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十一首 其二","author":"释有权","text":"秀才觅火和烟得，长沙卖石著云饶。\n欲知千佛居何土，赢得诗禅价转高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12525,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十一首 其一","author":"释有权","text":"石上栽花分外奇，枝头春色暗芳菲。\n馨香遍界无人嗅，一任狂风取次吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12526,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其三","author":"释有权","text":"禅禅，无党无偏。\n迷时千里隔，悟在口皮边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12527,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其二","author":"释有权","text":"今朝结却布袋口，明眼衲僧莫乱走。\n心行灭处解翻身，喷嚏也成师子吼。\n旃檀林，任驰骤。\n剔起眉毛顶上生，剜肉成疮露家丑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12528,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其一","author":"释有权","text":"黑漆昆崙把钓竿，古帆高挂下惊湍。\n芦花影里弄明月，引得盲龟上钓船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12529,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十一首 其九","author":"释有权","text":"佛手驴脚生缘，浩浩丛林盛传。\n直饶一穿穿却，未免十万八千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12530,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十一首 其八","author":"释有权","text":"人人有个生缘，男儿气宇冲天。\n若是争田竞地，我即唤死如眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12531,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十一首 其七","author":"释有权","text":"我脚何似驴脚，踏著赵州略彴。\n惊得迦叶皱眉，文殊却打无著。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12532,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十一首 其六","author":"释有权","text":"我手何似佛手，二八恰恰十九。\n年尾算到年头，家内一钱无有。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12533,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临终诗","author":"释有规","text":"读书已觉眉棱重，就枕方欣骨节和。\n睡起不知天早晚，西窗残日已无多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12534,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵州勘婆颂","author":"释自回","text":"三军不动旗闪烁，老婆正是魔王脚。\n赵州无柄铁扫帚，扫荡烟尘空索索。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12535,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"见石火省彻颂","author":"释自回","text":"用尽工夫，浑无巴鼻。\n火光迸散，元在这里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12536,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"化前题壁","author":"释自在","text":"邑尉非常气势豪，因谈真教反称褒。\n吾家微密皆彰露，又往西天去一遭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12537,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其二","author":"释自贤","text":"一身高隐惟南岳，自笑孤云未是闲。\n松下水边端坐者，也应随倒说居山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12538,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其三","author":"释自贤","text":"五更残月落，天晓白云飞。\n分明目前事，不是目前机。\n欲言言不及，林下却商量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12539,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其一","author":"释自贤","text":"不是心，不是佛，不是物。\n与君打破精灵窟，簸土飞扬无处寻，千山万山突突兀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12540,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"广润寺新寮","author":"释自南","text":"客不赴斋招，冥心坐寂寥。\n青山若厌看，白日也难消。\n鹭起冲荷叶，虫行蚀菊苗。\n何年称老宿，来住此间寮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12541,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈高庵偈","author":"释自圆","text":"外国言音不可穷，起云亭下一时通。\n口门广大无边际，吞尽杨歧栗棘蓬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12542,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂","author":"释自圆","text":"南北东西万万千，乾坤上下两无边。\n相逢相见呵呵笑，屈指抬头月半天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12543,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释自清","text":"粪箕扛去轿抬回，优钵昙花向日开。\n但愿老僧高著眼，管教平地一声雷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12544,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游洞霄得乡友道士邓君德清话因成古语","author":"释自彰","text":"乱山倚伏龙蛇蟠，苍藤古木门径寒。\n蕊宫潭潭列万础，碧楼朱户参云端。\n吾闻上界足官府，谪下名山作仙侣。\n我来寻仙访泉石，落日浮云随杖屦。\n道士邓君吾故人，汲泉煮茗慰酸辛。\n笑谈未厌樵柯烂，回首人间五百春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12545,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古","author":"释行","text":"满满弯弓射不著，长长挥剑斫无痕。\n堪笑日月不到处，个中别是一乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12546,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临终偈","author":"释行元","text":"来亦无所从，去亦无所至。\n来去既一如，春风满天地。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12547,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送空维那","author":"释行巩","text":"十载中原一棹还，碧琉璃外更无山。\n扣舷三下知谁会，自作吴音唱月弯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12548,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十首 其十","author":"释行巩","text":"恰好被人借去了，莫言邻舍不通容。\n团圞无缝难安笔，只抹烟云一两重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12549,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十首 其九","author":"释行巩","text":"白浪堆中下一钩，锦鳞红尾尚悠悠。\n渔翁不计竿头事，笑入芦花万顷秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12550,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十首 其八","author":"释行巩","text":"万德不自有，十身何处藏。\n薰风生殿阁，化日正舒长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12551,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十首 其七","author":"释行巩","text":"学海波澜捲未乾，几烦仙屐上林峦。\n天香吹落秋风老，不觉相携到广寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12552,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十首 其五","author":"释行巩","text":"柴火煎熬担在身，相逢狭路不堪论。\n淡烟落日青山外，满地难收刀斧痕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12553,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十首 其三","author":"释行巩","text":"领得沩山笑里刀，方知不枉到明招。\n元来树倒藤枯后，了得三年五载烧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12554,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十首 其二","author":"释行巩","text":"高烧榾柮暖通身，快活难禁一屋春。\n不是谢郎来合火，谁知门外有寒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12555,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂三首 其二","author":"释行巩","text":"山静课花蜂股重，林空含箨笋肌明。\n倚阑不觉成痴兀，又得黄鹂唤一声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12556,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十首 其六","author":"释行巩","text":"错错，戏海狞龙，冲霄辽鹤。\n老慈明，无著莫，笑里重重露拴索。\n佛手一展日月昏，大江从此风涛恶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12557,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十首 其四","author":"释行巩","text":"百尺竿头五两垂，穷沙绝漠任风吹。\n可怜无限沧浪客，犹把南针定所归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12558,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古十首 其一","author":"释行巩","text":"玉殿苔生正不居，四臣无路纳嘉谟。\n老农知是承谁力，风暖歌声落野锄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12559,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂三首 其三","author":"释行巩","text":"雪峰辊毬，禾山打鼓。\n秘魔擎叉，道吾作舞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12560,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂三首 其一","author":"释行巩","text":"横眸碧汉，万国风清。\n垂手红尘，千峰日出。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12561,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送育维那","author":"释行机","text":"克宾一字入公门，有理难伸笑杀人。\n隐静不行兴化令，他年谁道棒头亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12562,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四首 其四","author":"释行机","text":"东西南北无门户，大地山河不覆藏。\n今夜碧天云脚尽，一钩月挂几人肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12563,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四首 其三","author":"释行机","text":"青蛇提起气腥臊，几个男儿有痛毛。\n直下血流犹未觉，举头还见铁山高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12564,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四首 其二","author":"释行机","text":"隔林彷佛闻机杼，知有人家在翠微。\n及至入门亲见了，元来只是小儿戏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12565,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古四首 其一","author":"释行机","text":"叶落岗头一望长，几茎乔木倚斜阳。\n曾经巴峻猿啼处，铁打心肝寸断肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12566,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其三","author":"释行机","text":"仲秋八月旦，庭户入新凉。\n不露风骨句，愁人知夜长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12567,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其二","author":"释行机","text":"圆通不开生药铺，单单只卖死猫头。\n不知那个无思算，吃著通身冷汗流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12568,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂","author":"释重喜","text":"地炉无火一囊空，雪似杨花落岁穷。\n乞得苧麻缝破衲，不知身在寂寥中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12569,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧造普同塔","author":"释行机","text":"珊珊玉骨本玲珑，挂角羚羊不见踪。\n特地作亭图甚么，为怜松竹引清风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12570,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十三夜闻雁","author":"释行海","text":"年年风景暗相催，雁叶初红雁又来。\n枕上一声闻最苦，江南人望寄书回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12571,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月三日寒食","author":"释行海","text":"三月初三寒食雨，春光黯淡似秋光。\n羽书未报江东捷，何日看花到洛阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12572,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小池","author":"释行海","text":"白绵飞尽绿丝深，无数鱼儿聚藻阴。\n日夜潺湲声不断，分明一片伯牙心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12573,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小游仙","author":"释行海","text":"青鸟衔书遍海涯，香风不返五云车。\n可怜夜夜瑶池月，空照蟠桃一树花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12574,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山窗即景","author":"释行海","text":"阴阴苔坎乱鸣蛙，光射林霏落月斜。\n池面绿铺蕉叶影，露阶红遍凤儿花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12575,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"己酉作","author":"释行海","text":"十载风烟不暂闲，往来吴越旧江山。\n如今结屋云深处，不欲听人话世间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12576,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书野店壁","author":"释行海","text":"门径斜斜草色深，伤春蝴蝶亦伤心。\n野花落尽无人见，空有黄鹂啭绿阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12577,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天台清溪","author":"释行海","text":"碧草生芽鸟弄春，短长亭外柳条新。\n钓船来往清溪上，定有桃花洞里人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12578,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天竺冬夜","author":"释行海","text":"白云寂寂树苍苍，夜静泉声到石房。\n淡月照窗寒梦醒，枕边闻得野梅香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12579,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天姥道中","author":"释行海","text":"春风陌上野花香，目送北归鸿雁行。\n百里青山行不尽，隔烟啼鸟又斜阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":12580,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]